        "title": "顿: measure compatible referents",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "顿 counts meals and certain bounded actions such as a scolding. Learn the compatible event, not an arbitrary duration.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "我吃了一顿饭。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ chī le yī dùn fàn 。",
                "meaning": "I ate a meal.",
                "audio": "059785cd3c58715375305f67440a884267a0d356d5eb56d261ba903a124102d4"
              },
              {
                "text": "他请我吃了一顿饭。",
                "pinyin": "tā qǐng wǒ chī le yī dùn fàn 。",
